    <section class="detail-section" id="features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
      <div class="wrap detail-grid">
        <h2 id="features-title">AI skills for everyday work</h2>
        <div><p class="prose-lead">Exercises cover writing prompts, checking AI responses and deciding what data you can share with a tool. Examples relate to different roles at work.</p><div class="feature-groups"><section aria-labelledby="campus-f1"><h3 id="campus-f1">Short videos and exercises</h3><p>The core course takes about an hour and a half. Progress is saved, so staff can complete it in sessions that fit their working day.</p></section><section aria-labelledby="campus-f2"><h3 id="campus-f2">Final exam and certificate</h3><p>The exam has 30 scenario questions and typically takes another 20–30 minutes. Passing it earns a verifiable certificate.</p></section><section aria-labelledby="campus-f3"><h3 id="campus-f3">Skills register</h3><p>Administrators can see who has completed training and who is still working through it. Course completions, exam results and policy acknowledgements are recorded in the service.</p></section></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="detail-section" id="policy" aria-labelledby="policy-title">
      <div class="wrap detail-grid">
        <h2 id="policy-title">Shared guidelines for using AI</h2>
        <div class="prose"><p>Answer a questionnaire about how your organisation uses AI. The AI assistant creates a draft that you can edit through a conversation. Set out approved tools, data handling rules and who checks the results.</p><p>The builder, policy publishing, staff acknowledgements and version history are free. Your organisation reviews and approves its own policy.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="detail-section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricing-title">
      <div class="wrap detail-grid">
        <h2 id="pricing-title">Training with an annual licence</h2>
        <div class="prose"><p>The annual licence costs €99 + VAT and includes 10 users, training, the final exam, certificates and the skills register. Each additional user costs €4.90 per year + VAT.</p><p>A free account lets you create an AI policy and try the first training module with up to five users.</p><p><a class="button button-primary" href="https://campus.aigen.fi">Explore Campus</a></p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

